  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Western Balkans: Investing in Democratic Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The framework will focus on three key objectives: (1) Democratic actors and institutions are more resilient; (2) Western Balkans democratic institutions become more inclusive and representative of marginalised groups, including women and youth; (3) Western Balkans democratic institutions work in more transparent and deliberative way in the interest of citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
